{
  "job_C22_20251003_115239": {
    "text": "Suffragare trinitatis unitas, unitatis miserere trinitas gefultimige seo \u00ferinis seo annis \u00f0\u00e6re annisse\nsuffragare quaeso mihi posito maris magni uelut in periculo gefultimige ic bidde me gesettum saes\nut non secum trahat me mortalitas huius anni neque mundi uanitas \u00fe\u00e6tte nal\u00e6s mid heo teo mec seo\net hoc idem peto a sublimibus celestis militie uirtutibus & \u00f0\u00e6t ilce ic bidde from \u00fe\u00e6m hyhstum \u00fe\u00e6s\nne me linquant lacerandum hostibus sed defendant me iam armis fortibus \u00f0yl\u00e6s mec forl\u00e6ten to slitenne\nut me illi precedant in acie celestis exercitus militie \u00fe\u00e6tte heo mec foregongen in fe\u00f0an \u00f0\u00e6s heofonlican\ncheruphin et seraphin cum milibus, michael et gabriel similibus wisdomes gefylnes & godes lufu\nopto thronos, uirtutes, archangelos, principatus, potestates, angelos ic wisce \u00ferymseld \u00fea lyfiendan\nut me denso defendentes agmine inimicos ualeam prosternere \u00fe\u00e6tte mec \u00feicce gescyldende weorode\ntum deinde ceteros agonithetas, patriarchas, quattuor quater prophetas sy\u00fe\u00fean \u00e6fter \u00fean o\u00f0re c\u00e6mpan\net apostolos nauis christi proretas, et martyres omnes peto athletas ond apostolas christes scipes steoran\natque adiuro et uirgines omnes, uiduas fideles et confessores.\nut me per illos salus sepiat atque omne malum a me pereat \u00fe\u00e6tte mec \u00feurh heo \u00fe\u00e6re ecean h\u00e6lo\nchristus mecum pactum firmum fereat, timor tremor tetras turbas terreat crist mid me were f\u00e6ste trume\ndeus inpenetrabili tutela undique me defende potentia god un\u00feurhsceotendlicre gescyldnesse \u00e6ghwonan\nmee gibre pernas omnes libera tuta pelta protegente singula mines lichoman lewera alle al\u00e6s gesundum\nut non tetri demones in latera mea librent ut soleant iacula \u00fe\u00e6tte nal\u00e6s \u00f0a sweartan deoblu in mine\ngigram, cephalen cum iaris, et conas patham, liganam, sennas atque michinas \u00feone hnoll \u00f0a\ncladum, crassum, madianum, talias bathma, exugiam, adque binas idumas swiran hryncg sidan lendenu\nmeo ergo cum capillis uertice galea salutis esto capite minum so\u00felice mid gescyldrum hneccan helm\nfronte, oculis, et cerebro triforme, rostro, labie, facie, timpore hneofolan eagum ond exon \u00fe\u00e6re\nmento, barbe superciliis auribus, genis, buccis, internaso, naribus cinne bearde oferbruum earum\npupillis, rotis, palpebris, tautonibus, ginguis, anile, maxillis faucibus seonum eahringum br\u00e6wum\ndentibus, lingue, ore, ubae, guttore, gurgulione et sublingue ceruice to\u00f0um tungan mu\u00f0e hr\u00e6ctungan\ncapitali, ceotro, cartilagine, collo clemens adesto tutamine heafodlocan br\u00e6gene gristlan swiran arf\u00e6st\ndeinde esto lurica tutissima erga membra erga mea uiscera \u00e6fter \u00feon beo\u00f0u me byrne seo\nut retrudas a me inuisibilis sudum clabos quos fingunt odibiles \u00fe\u00e6tte \u00f0u ascufe from me \u00f0a\ntege ergo deus fortis lurica cum scapulis humeros et brachia gescyld so\u00f0lice god strongre byrnan mid\ntege ulnas cum cubis et manibus pugnos, palmas, digitos cum ungibus gemundbyrd elne mid \u00fean\ntege spinam et costas cum artibus, terga dorsum neruosque cum ossibus gescyld \u00feone hringc & \u00f0a ribb\ntege cutem, sanguinem cum renibus, catacrines, nates, cum femoribus gescyld \u00f0a hyd blod mid \u00f0\u00e6m\ntege cambas, surras, femoralia cum genuclis, poplites et genua gescyld homme scotliran \u00f0a\ntege ramos concrescentes decies, cum mentagris ungues binos quinquies gemundbyrd telgan\ntege talos cum tibiis et calcibus, crura, pedes, plantarum cum bassibus gescyld \u00f0a h\u00e6lan mid \u00fe\u00e6m\ntege pectus, iugulam, pectusculum, mamillas stomachum et umbilicum gescyld breost \u00f0earmwind\ntege uentrem, lumbos, genetalia, et aluum, et cordis uitalia gescyld \u00f0a wombe \u00fea lendenu \u00fea\ntege trifidum iecor et ilia, marsem, reniculos, fithrem cum obligio gescyld \u00fea \u00feriofealdan libre & rysele\ntege toliam, toracem cum pulmone, uenas, fibras, fel cum bucliamini gescyld readan felefer\u00f0 mid \u00f0\u00e6re\ntege carnem, inguinem cum medullis, splenem cum tortuosis intestinis gescyld \u00fe\u00e6t fl\u00e6sc o\u00f0\u00f0e\ntege uesicam, adipem et pantas compaginum innumeros ordines gescyld bl\u00e6dran gelynd ond alle \u00feara\ntege pilos adque membra reliqua quorum forte pr\u00e6teribi nomina gescyld h\u00e6r & \u00fea o\u00fere leomu \u00fe\u00e6ra\ntege totum me cum quinque sensibus et cum X fabrefactis foribus gescyld alne mec mid fif ondgeotum\nut a plantis usque ad uerticem nullo membro foris intus egrotem \u00fe\u00e6tte from \u00fe\u00e6m h\u00e6lum o\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6s\nne de meo possit uitam trudere pestis febris languor dolor corpore \u00feyl\u00e6s of minum m\u00e6ge lif ascufan\ndonec iam deo dante seneam et peccata mea bonis deleam \u00e6r\u00f0on so\u00f0lice gode syllendum ic gealdige &\nut de carne iens imis caream et ad alta euolare ualeam \u00fe\u00e6tte of lichoman utgeongende \u00f0eosum neolum\net miserto deo ad etheria letus uehar regni refrigeria, amen & gemilsigendum gode to \u00fe\u00e6m readorlicum",
